、许寄（一作许奇）、许猛，其中许猛官至西晋幽州刺史。后裔绵延至东晋许询、唐代许敬宗、许远。","tc":"漢末大司農，仕歷典農校尉、郡守，高陽許氏奠基人。其子許允，官至曹魏中領軍、鎮北將軍。孫子許武、許寄（一作許奇）、許猛，其中許猛官至西晉幽州刺史。后裔綿延至東晉許詢、唐代許敬宗、許遠。","en":"Minister of Finance in the late Han, who served successively as Agricultural Officer and Commandery Governor, and the founding patriarch of the Gaoyang Xu clan. His son Xu Yun rose to Central Army Commander and General Who Pacifies the North in Cao Wei. His grandsons were Xu Wu, Xu Ji (also written as Xu Qi), and Xu Meng, among whom Xu Meng rose to Inspector of You Province in the Western Jin. His lineage extended to Xu Xun of the Eastern Jin, as well as Xu Jingzong and Xu Yuan of the Tang Dynasty.","jp":"後漢末の大司農。典農校尉や郡守を歴任し、高陽許氏の礎を築いた。子の許允は魏の中領軍、鎮北将軍にまで至った。孫に許武、許寄（許奇とも）、許猛がおり、中でも許猛は西晋で幽州刺史となった。その後裔は東晋の許詢、唐代の許敬宗や許遠へと連なっている。","kr":"후한 말의 대사농으로, 전농교위와 군수를 역임하며 고양 허씨의 기틀을 마련한 인물이다. 아들 허윤은 조위에서 관직이 중령군, 진북장군에 이르렀다. 손자로는 허무, 허기(혹은 허기[許奇]), 허맹이 있었는데, 그중 허맹은 서진에서 유주자사를 지냈다. 그 후손은 동진의 허순, 당대의 허경종과 허원 등으로 이어졌다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1033215","remark":"","surname":"许","surnameTc":"許","surnameEn":"Xu","surnameJp":"許","surnameKr":"허","surnameOther":"","name":"据","nameTc":"據","nameEn":"Ju","nameJp":"拠","nameKr":"거","nameOther":"","word":"泰政","wordTc":"泰政","wordEn":"Taizheng","wordJp":"泰政","wordKr":"태정","wordOther":"","icon":"许据","power":"WJ10001","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"184","city":"CS1027","gender":"0","rule":"45","force":"22","wise":"68","politics":"67","charm":"62","will":"66","ruleTalent":"6","forceTalent":"1","wiseTalent":"7","politicsTalent":"7","charmTalent":"6","willTalent":"7","weaponMaster":"13/11/12/10/12/68/13/10","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"700"